COMPETITOR
│
├── 1. IDENTITY                              [who they are — the "at a glance" layer]
│   ├── 1.1 Snapshot                         one-liner, tier, why-they-compete
│   ├── 1.2 Positioning                      value prop, differentiation claim
│   ├── 1.3 Target Audience / ICP            who they actually speak to
│   └── 1.4 Similarity to Us                 C1/C2/C3 scores + rationale
│
├── 2. PRODUCT & WEBSITE                     [what they sell + how the site sells it]
│   ├── 2.1 Highlight Features               the features they push hardest
│   ├── 2.2 Most-Attractive Features         the standout / hero features + why they land
│   ├── 2.3 Messaging & Conversion           headline copy, pricing, CTAs, funnel, social proof
│   └── 2.4 Insights to Imbibe               what we can borrow from how the SITE converts
│
├── 3. SOCIAL PRESENCE                       [the numbers layer — per platform]
│   └── (per platform: IG / LinkedIn / X / TikTok / YouTube)
│       ├── 3.x.1 Profile Stats              followers, verified, bio/links
│       ├── 3.x.2 Cadence & Consistency      how often, how regular
│       ├── 3.x.3 Format Mix                 % reel / carousel / static / story
│       ├── 3.x.4 Engagement Rate            normalized to followers (not raw likes)
│       └── 3.x.5 Growth Velocity            trajectory from dated snapshots
│
├── 4. CONTENT STRATEGY                      [the substance layer — what/how they post]
│   ├── 4.1 Content Pillars / Themes         the 3-6 recurring topic buckets
│   ├── 4.2 Recurring Series / Franchises    named repeatable formats
│   ├── 4.3 Hook Patterns                    how they open (spoken first-line + on-cover text)
│   ├── 4.4 CTA / Funnel Intent              awareness vs. conversion, what they ask for
│   ├── 4.5 Brand Voice / Tone               how they sound
│   └── 4.6 Production Style                 polished vs. raw/UGC, trend/audio usage
│
├── 5. TOP PERFORMERS                        [the proof layer — their best content]
│   └── (per post, top 10-20)
│       ├── 5.x.1 The Content                type, transcript (reel) or caption+cover (static)
│       ├── 5.x.2 The Numbers                likes / comments / shares / saves / views
│       └── 5.x.3 Why It Won                 the teardown + the repeatable formula
│
├── 6. PAID & PARTNERSHIPS                   [what they pay to amplify]
│   ├── 6.1 Active Ads                       Meta Ad Library: live creatives + angles + longevity
│   └── 6.2 Partnerships                     influencer / UGC / branded-content
│
├── 7. AUDIENCE & COMMUNITY                  [what the audience says back]
│   ├── 7.1 Sentiment                        praise vs. complaints
│   ├── 7.2 Whitespace                       gaps in what audience wants → we can own
│   ├── 7.3 Responsiveness                   do they reply, how fast
│   └── 7.4 Owned Community                  discord / newsletter / group
│
└── 8. SYNTHESIS                             [the verdict layer — the "so what"]
    ├── 8.1 Winning Formula                  their strategy in one line
    ├── 8.2 Recent Strategic Shifts          what changed lately
    ├── 8.3 Steal / Avoid / Test             the actionable list
    └── 8.4 Hooks into Content Packs         which pillars/hooks/formats feed the reel packs